          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: “Bala abantu ab'olulyo lwa Merari, ng'ojiira ku nsimuko dhaibwe ni ku nda dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bala abasaadha ab'emyaka okuva ku makumi asatu okutuuka ku ataanu, abaikirizibwa okungira ni bakola emirimo mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulimo gwaibwe mu Weema eyo gwidha kubanga gwa kubbeeda bino: ebikondo eby'Eweema eyo, n'embaawo edhikiikamu, n'empango, n'ebikolo ebyemereraku ebikondo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'empango edh'oluya olwezungulula Weema eyo, n'ebikolo byadho, n'enkondo edhireega, n'emigugha, n'ebintu ebikozesebwa ku bintu ebyo. Buli muntu oidha kumughanga ekintu ky'anaabanga n'okubbeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo n'emirimo Abalevi abasimuka mu Merari gye banaakolanga mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. Ithamari mutabane wa Aaroni kabona n'anaabalabiriranga mu kukola emirimo egyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
